(created/updated times. The follow feature is implemented as a separate table that stores user_id) Tj
0 -16 Td
(and report_id pairs. A user can follow a report or unfollow it with dedicated endpoints, and the) Tj
0 -16 Td
(backend prevents duplicate follow rows.) Tj
