0 -16 Td
() Tj
0 -16 Td
(The repository contains a dedicated duplicate detection module in ml/duplicates/detector.py. The) Tj
0 -16 Td
(current implementation is rule-based, not a fully trained AI model: it compares reports by) Tj
0 -16 Td
(category and by distance, and marks them as duplicates when the same category appears within 200) Tj
0 -16 Td
(metres. The backend stores duplicate suggestions separately as a duplicate_suggestions table,) Tj
0 -16 Td
(with a score between 0 and 1 and JSON reasons such as location, category, and time. This is how) Tj
0 -16 Td
(the app can present ?possible duplicates? to a verifier before merging takes place.) Tj
0 -16 Td
