0 -16 Td
(parent report id. The parent?s report_count is recomputed so that it reflects the parent plus) Tj
0 -16 Td
(all merged child cases. This avoids drift and ensures the count is always accurate. When) Tj
0 -16 Td
(combining reports, the system moves any already-merged children up to the parent so the merge) Tj
0 -16 Td
(tree remains shallow and consistent. The verifier can see duplicate suggestions with GET) Tj
0 -16 Td
(/reports/{id}/duplicates, then approve the merge with POST /reports/{id}/merge or reverse it) Tj
